# One line end on each host: tests search text files for LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
# The seeds of the fuzz targets are bytes: no change of line end.
fuzz/seeds/** -text
# A signed file and its bundle are bytes: one changed byte fails the check.
crates/pod-release/tests/fixtures/** -text
# The merge of the branch of an agent: the rows of the index one id at a
# time, and the counts derived again (scripts/agent/merge_todo.py; the
# driver is set by scripts/session-start.sh). Without the driver, git
# merges the text.
TODO/INDEX.md merge=podcrates-todo
TODO/PROGRESS.md merge=podcrates-todo
